---
import BaseLayout from '../components/BaseLayout.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site';
---

<BaseLayout title="页面未找到 | 育才物理创新实验室" description="您访问的页面不存在或已被移动。">
  <section class="section-band bg-lab">
    <div class="page-shell text-center">
      <p class="eyebrow">404 NOT FOUND</p>
      <h1 class="mt-3 text-4xl font-black text-ink sm:text-5xl">页面未找到</h1>
      <p class="mx-auto mt-5 max-w-xl leading-8 text-slate-700">
        您访问的页面不存在或已被移动。部分历史页面（如学生作品库）已经下线，可以从下面的入口继续浏览。
      </p>
      <div class="mt-9 flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-3">
        <a href="/" class="focus-ring inline-flex h-12 items-center justify-center rounded-md bg-yucai-700 px-6 text-sm font-bold text-white transition hover:bg-yucai-800">返回首页</a>
        {
          site.nav
            .filter((item) => item.href !== '/')
            .map((item) => (
              <a
                href={item.href}
                class="focus-ring inline-flex h-12 items-center justify-center rounded-md border border-yucai-600 bg-white px-6 text-sm font-bold text-yucai-700 transition hover:bg-yucai-50"
              >
                {item.label}
              </a>
            ))
        }
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
